      "backstory": "Drew has been organizing the office holiday party for three years, and last year's event at the downtown hotel was a huge success, with over 50 attendees enjoying the catering and decorations. This year, Drew is considering alternative venues to avoid the long wait for the elevator that caused some guests to arrive late.",
