      "backstory": "Morgan has been looking forward to the holiday party all year, and is particularly excited about the possibility of having it at the new rooftop bar that just opened up near the office, where they had a great experience attending a friend's birthday party. However, Morgan is also concerned about the bar's limited seating capacity and noise level, which might not be suitable for some colleagues.",
