      "goal": "Quinn wants to share their ideas and preferences for the party venue, and is open to exploring unconventional options that will make the celebration special and engaging for all attendees.",
      "backstory": "As the guest of honor, Quinn is thrilled to be celebrating a major work anniversary and is hoping the party will be a memorable and fun celebration, perhaps at a unique venue like the local art museum or a private room at a trendy restaurant, where they can mingle with colleagues in a more intimate setting. Last year, Quinn attended a similar event at a museum and was impressed by the atmosphere and catering.",
